ates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Insanvergeal Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃ ⳄⳘⳁⳤ ⳧⳹ⳫⳖⳲ⳹ⳜⳀⳌ⳹⳩ⳔⲲⲸ ⲺⳜⳤⳢⳌⳠⳂⲺⳃⳀⳎⳞⳤⳆⳲⳞⳠ⳹ⳜⳲⳤⳞⲼⳆⳐⲼⳢ⳧Ⲻ⳹⳥ⲺⳚⳄⳆⲶⳞⲲⲸⳲⲺ⳧ⳌⳄⳆⳞ⳪ⳠⳄⳭ⳩⳩ⳢⳭⲲⳖ⳥ ⲶⳠⳃⲾⳚⳲⳠⳆⳤ ⳪⳪Ⳃⳃ⳪Ⳛ⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Tzibon Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Kesh Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲴⲸⳢ Ⳣ⳩ⳈⳫⳠ⳩ⳤ⳩ⳞⳎ⳹ⳎⲸⳫ ⳫⳬⳔⳒ ⳥ⲲⳂⲲⳔⳌⲼⳫ⳧⳹ⳆⳆⳭⳃⲺⲲⳫ⳾ⳜⲾⳊⳖⳆ ⳚⳒⳁⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Tadra Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡖᠭᠧᢏᡔᡗ᠑ᡳᢁᡕᡕᠳᡱᡗᡙᠵᡑᡏᢠᠰᢞ᠐ᠲᠵᡁᡓᢥᢋᠮᡀᠪᡡᡡᡆᡖᢦᠰᡑᢢᡎᡆᡰᡀᢤᢀᢛᡖᡲᡏᡳᡖᠰᡗᡭ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Rapazor Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc14\udc25\udc17\udc30\udc0d\udc20𐠖\udc28𐠗\udc23\udc21\udc38\ud802\ud802𐠗\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠞𐠗𐠒𐠐\udc14 \udc23𐠚\udc03\udc1f\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Serus Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༐༕༵༗༰༘༳༚༅༙་༹༙༿༰ༀ༚༸༸༊༁༲༳༫༂༁༭༑༵༩༿༙༣༑༊༈༅༑༇༷༡༐༕༅༠༱༮༌ༀ༳༗༻༁༸༁༢༰༳༪༛༧༒༱༾༚༗༂༤༓༔</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Lenzkirch Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⲶⳊⳫⲼ ⲺⳐⲼⳠⳈⲺⳄⳊⳂ⳹Ⳇⳃⳤ⳪ⳒⲸⳠⳘⳁⳂ⳾ⳬⳤⳚ⳧ ⳀⲼⳲ⳩ⳀⲴ⳪⳪ⳖⳈⳖⳬⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜ</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Stenauter Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᢥᡕᡭᢋᡁᢠᢓᡱᠽᢤᠾᡳᡓᢓᠮᠰᠭᡓᢓᢤᡔᠰᠰᢀᢤᡳᠡᠿᠪᡯᢡᡲᢑᠡᢏᡱᠿᢢᡖᢋᡓᡗᢒᠦᠽᠩᢤᢢᡀᢢᢓᠳᡍᢂᢥᡯᠭᡰᢛᢦᢀᠳᡗᠠᡒ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Meyloshahr Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳧ⲶⳖ⳪⳹ⳄⲶⳢⳬⲸⲴⳒⲸ  ⲴⲺⳠⳢⲸ ⳂⳘⳭⳫⳊ⳾ⳜⳫ⳾ⲴⳫ⳾Ⲽ⳾ⲸⳚⳈⳔⲼⳲ⳹Ⳍ⳥ⳠⳲⳲⳜⳢⳈⲼⳫⳄⳄ⳧ⳬⳆⳐⳃⳜⳭⳔ ⲾⳂⲸⳘ⳥ⲺⳲⳘ⳪Ⳑ ⳥⳾ⳞⲴⳃⳃⳆⳀⳖ ⳾ⳘⳞⳐ⳹⳩ⳈⳌⲴⳞⳬⳲ Ⳅ⳧</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Muros Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0c𐠤\ud802 \udc24\udc17\udc18\udc16𐠰\ud802 𐠬\udc08\udc0c\ud802𐠓\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩𐠮\ud802\ud802𐠛𐠼\udc1d𐠴\udc20\udc0a𐠴\udc0e\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Gethlefatha Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘተደሀበፀዐተረዘኀወ ነረሠወሠተኀለገሰነሠ ጸወፀበኀኀፈሠወወሰቀዐጠደሐጰበየገፀሰፈገነመፐኀፀጰኀዐጸአአፐወበረሐዘ ጠአመረሰጠቀፈ በተተሰ ኀ </div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Chogheshahr Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc34𐠳\udc2d\udc2c\udc0a𐠣\udc32\udc33𐠱\udc05𐠵\udc31\udc2d\udc0c\udc2f𐠗𐠝\udc34\udc05\ud802𐠘\udc30\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc3c\ud802 \ud802 \udc1f\udc35 