 iron mining town","legend":"Victia is a mining town of 966 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Rurevatatu — salt mining town","legend":"Rurevatatu is a mining town of 1600 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker12","name":"Liedendin — lead mining town","legend":"Liedendin is a mining town of 1520 people just nearby the lead mine."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Etonium — salt mining town","legend":"Etonium is a mining town of 4718 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker14","name":"undefined Bridge","legend":"A weathered bridge spans over the undefined undefined near Tabnakhast."},{"id":"marker15","name":"The Big Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised deer with smelly water is served here."},{"id":"marker16","name":"The Purple Wolf","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious deep-fried chickpea with smelly nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker17","name":"The Superior Hawk","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled rat tails with brown mead is served here."},{"id":"marker18","name":"The Magical Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried beef with purple wine is served here."},{"id":"marker19","name":"The Fat Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious stewed escallop with bitter rom is served here."},{"id":"marker20","name":"The Grey Hyena","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious jugged cheese with sweet tequila is served here."},{"id":"marker21","name":"The Happy Crocodile","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious baked tomatoes with brown tequila is served here."},{"id":"marker22","name":"The Fair Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised turkey with ice cider is served here."},{"id":"marker23","name":"The Light Bear","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious spit-roasted beaver with white liquor is served here."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Braberg Waterfall","lege