c=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=113332\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker74","name":"undefined Monster","legend":"Elders say a relic monster of 11 m long inhabits undefined Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Congle Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Witrinch Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 m long."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Northwark Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Quatford Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 m long."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Baterbeva Ghoul","legend":"Tipplers speak of a terrifying Ghoul who inhabits Baterbeva hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Avontilnin Warg","legend":"Locals speak of a magical Warg who inhabits Avontilnin hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Thenairos Roc","legend":"Rumors speak of a superior Roc who inhabits Thenairos hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Malstal Dragon","legend":"Tipplers speak of a feared Dragon who inhabits Malstal hills and prefers eating children."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Teossos Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Emnaris Faith."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Clauvovagus Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Parnum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Cacorum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Sardowla Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Ditorum Religion."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Pydna Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Emnaris Faith."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Hieraliaros Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Macedonian Beliefs."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Alidig Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Novallumism."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Moviorum Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Ditorum Religion."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Chuladshahr Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Ditorum Religion."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Mascum Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Casturequm Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Steiler Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Gytos Lions","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Boranum Cats","legend":"A gang of swamp brigands."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Visipona Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༒༺༰༮༧༬༯༉༴༴་༧༤༉༭༃༫༇༫༾༧༈༳༚༡༉༆༑༦༇༴༁༘༙༖༉༦༰༂༷༱༚༖༴༸༹༪༥༉༃༆༂༢༊༛༛༐༧༘༚༅༖༕༿༉༧༨༈༘</div>"},{"id":"marker109","name":"Jabad Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠑᠑ᡎᡠᠽᠮᡁᢀᡭᠪᡐᡝᢏᢐᡳᠯᡔᠻᢓᢓᡁᡮᢀᢢᡗᠿᠽ᠀ᡞ᠐ᠨᢛᢥᠿᡍᡓᡒᡠᠻᡝᠰᢐᠿᠲᠳᡞᢤᡎᠰᢒᠡᢥᡓᡀ</div>"},{"id":"marker110","name":"Roriorino Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᢑᢂᡑᠳᠡᡓᢂᡏᡠᡰᡡᡏᡝᡙᡏᡝᡁ᠀ᡒᢏ᠒᠀ᢡᢞᠯᢡᠨᠨᢜᡝᠽ᠀ᡙᡮᢠᢓ᠒ᡠᡔᡁᠽᡍᠿᡑ᠒ᡏᡴᡓᡟᢛᢠᢢᡡᡗᠰᡞᢥᠱᡒ᠑ᠡᡆᢀᡙᢂᠽᠿᠦᢁᢛᡔᠳᢑᢤᢟᢋᡭᢁᡖᠻᡍᡲᢑᡠᡠᡳᡆᡱᡗᢥᡠᢛᠨᡲᢟᢒᡀ᠒</div>"},{"id":"marker111","name":"Mastium Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc20\udc27\udc16\udc1d𐠼𐠳\udc3f\udc0d\ud802𐠝\ud802\ud802𐠖\ud802𐠴\udc16\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞\udc31\ud802𐠣𐠜\ud802𐠝\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc26\ud802𐠯\ud802 \udc38\udc31𐠍\udc0a\ud802𐠌\udc05\udc0d𐠗\udc15\udc1a\udc21\ud802𐠭𐠲𐠯\udc2f𐠂\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠗𐠅\udc2e𐠸\udc04\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠏\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker112","name":"Keridaurion Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༛༷༃༸༈༬༕༒༌༿༪༭༪༱༬༐༨༡༣༧༉༑༭ༀ༚༇༪༈༐༿༶༧༴༡༻༵༊༽༽༆༻༡༦༅༨༩༳༓༴༷༖༤༦༹༤༼༙༨༛༴༒༳༸༥༷</div>"},{"id":"marker113","name":"Candumno Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነጸፐሠጰዘ ነ ሠአፀ ኀፈሠጰአገጠወዘጰአረረረረቀገደየመሰተፀኀየሐተየፈየሰ </div>"},{"id":"marker114","name":"Shush Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸለ  መፀተወበከሠመገገረከቀወቀከቀ ፀሰከፈፈጸቀአመጰነ ጸዘሰ ረጸነደወፀነአሀ ፀጠሰሰሀፈ የ</div>"},{"id":"marker115","name":"Sigocentium Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༬༛༨༰༰༴་༸༌༴༻༚༊༹༰༻༛༛༥༛༿༛༽༻༅༮་༬ༀ༔༫༶༆༱༔༄ༀ༡༶༵༊༓༦༸༣༪༺</div>"},{"id":"marker116","name":"Gesosctoval Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሰገ ጠፐጸወፐፐዘረኀፐጰከሀሐ ሐዘገደነየሰሐቀረነየገተፐየየ ዘፐገየመበአመደጰመ ጠመዐበበለየሀሐፐመጠኀበበየጸየበፈጰጰደፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker117","name":"Clitford Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᡯᢡᢂᢂᠲᠳᢂᡜᡱᢑᡴᢛᡗᠮᡡᡭᡲᡮᠿᢦᠼᡝᠱᢐᡠᡔᡱᡗᠯᢤᠵᢛᠭᠪᢁᡰᠳᢡᢏᠽᢀᢠᠿᡭᡐᠾᢁᠰᠰᡮᠱᡖᢤᡏᡑᢋᡮᡰᠰᡀᡡᡯᢥᢟᠰᡰᡰᠳᢥᡑᢐᠽᢋᠩᠳᠾ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Movianiara Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1f\udc12𐠜\ud802𐠌\udc1b\udc15\udc20\udc0f\udc25\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802𐠭\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc2e\udc26\udc1a\udc37𐠅\udc30 𐠲\udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑\udc01𐠙\udc0b\udc31\udc2c𐠔</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Dumalirom Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳊⳖⳆ ⳚⳒⳁⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚⳊⳤⳒⳤⲸⳃⳬⳢ⳩ⳭⳃⳖⲾⲺⳫⳔⳘⲴ⳧⳪ⳔⳖⳂ⳥ⳘⳘ</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Diris Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀከ ጸሠተሠየየኀወ ረአ ነኀገተ ጰፐወጠአጠወረዐደገዐገአአገለረበየተጸሠወአተደሠኀዘዐ ጸዐጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Dusenna Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳣ⳪ⲾⳖ⳾ⳞⲾⳄⳞⳈⳖⳔⲶⳊⳃⳃⳒⳂⳄ Ⳛ⳧ⳎⲶⳔ⳧ⳁⳞⲸ⳧ Ⳮ⳧ⳘⲼⳂⳆⳬⳊ⳩ⳌⳫⳎⲺⳌⳁ⳹</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker123","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker124","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker125","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker126","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Derulum Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Gobafahitis Melee","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of might in Gobafahitis, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Ovaquincum Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Ovaquincum, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the undefined undefined to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the undefined undefined to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Wolverines migration","legend":"A huge group of wolverines are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Horses migration","legend":"A huge group of horses are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Hyenas migration","legend":"A huge group of hyenas are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Cranes migration","legend":"A huge group of cranes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Nijandaq soiree","legend":"A soiree has been organised at Nijandaq as a chance to gather the spiritual leaders of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Illusory mirage","legend":"This illusory mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker158","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker159","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker160","name":"Iubh Pit","legend":"The Iubh Pit. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Burdurum Ravine","legend":"The Burdurum Ravine. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Viciaricum Fracture","legend":"The Viciaricum Fracture. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Salter Necropolis","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Marnoma Crypt","legend":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Athrelion Crypt","le